评分变化、标的池更新\n5. **深度融合**：将Step 0的所有深度分析融入报告\n6. 生成《盘后速递》到 `src/outputs/盘后速递/YYYYMMDD_盘后速递.md`\n\n报告结构：\n- 大盘复盘→题材深度研判（含IMPS评估）→标的操作级判断→明日预判\n- 每个板块要有：数据支撑+逻辑推演+操作建议+IMPS评估\n\n### Step 2: 复制到docs目录\n```bash\ncp src/outputs/盘后速递/$(date +%Y%m%d)_盘后速递.md docs/aftermarket/$(date +%Y%m%d).md\npython src/md_to_html.py src/outputs/盘后速递/$(date +%Y%m%d)_盘后速递.md docs/aftermarket/$(date +%Y%m%d).html\ncp docs/aftermarket/$(date +%Y%m%d).html docs/aftermarket_latest.html\n```\n\n### Step 3: Git提交\n```bash\ncd ./长期计划/信息分析洞察计划\ngit add -A docs/\ngit commit -m \"盘后速递 $(date +%Y-%m-%d)\"\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n### Step 4: 推送企业微信\n```bash\npython src/beautified_push.py src/outputs/盘后速递/$(date +%Y%m%d)_盘后速递.md\n```\n\n## ⚠️ 推送规范\n- ✅ 只能使用 beautified_push.py 推送一次\n- ❌ 禁止使用 temp/ 目录下的脚本\n- ❌ 禁止手动调用企业微信Webhook\n\n## 质量要求\n- 有操作级判断（买点/止损/催化）\n- 数据来源标注\n- 传闻标注可信度\n- 非交易日不生成报告\n- 每个异动板块必须附IMPS评估\n\n## GitHub Pages链接\n- HTML版本：https://boya357.github.io/daily-news-insight/aftermarket/YYYYMMDD.html\n- Markdown版本：https://boya357.github.io/daily-news-insight/aftermarket/YYYYMMDD\n- Latest链接：https://boya357.github.io/daily-news-insight/aftermarket_latest.html","dtstart":"202605012030","dtend":"202605012100","is_recurring":true,"rrule":{"freq":"WEEKLY","interval":1,"byday":["MO","TU","WE","TH","FR"],"bymonthday":null,"bymonth":null,"until":"202605051336","count":0,"byhour":null,"byminute":null},"notify_type_str":"NOTIFY_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED","created_at":"202605011355","update_hint_json":"{\"can_update_current_uid\":false,\"requires_time_range\":true,\"reason_code\":\"ended_no_successor\",\"message\":\"当前事件已结束，且未找到可继续更新的后续事件。\",\"root_job_id\":\"5262f038-5597-4962-b254-db8eba501795\"}"},{"id":7629280838651281705,"uid":"14407707-b6c1-4588-b9f1-ba7ce7fb36e7","summary":"每日系统升级复盘","description":"【每日系统升级复盘任务】\n\n任务目标：持续推进系统升级，分析遗漏，优化算法\n\n执行步骤：\n1. **复盘分析**\n   - 查看今日遗漏个股\n   - 分析遗漏原因\n   - 更新复盘日志\n\n2. **检查升级任务进度**\n   - 查看 sub-agent session 执行结果\n   - 确认升级内容已集成\n\n3. **算法优化**\n   - 根据遗漏原因更新算法\n   -